      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_51",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Baglur",
            unit: "Baglur",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Thursagan",
            unit: "Thursagan",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Kinan",
            unit: "Kinan",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Rynan",
            unit: "Rynan",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("Well, these are the eastern mines, rich in quality minerals, but also home to trolls and other denizens of the darkness. Mining can take a while, this won’t be easy."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("For me to make the artifact Haldric wants, I need a special type of gold. I know not exactly where it can be found, but Baglur said these mines were the source of it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baglur",
            text: _("Aye, these mines yield the needed gold, but also the only coal that wi’ melt that gold."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("So we’re down here to get both the gold and coal. Simple enough, even if we have to fight for it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thursagan",
            text: _("Yes, although we will have to hire the miners — they don’t work for free. And you need to protect them while they do their work."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rugnur",
            text: _("Hrmm, that’s a good point... Well, these are old mines, not frontier caverns, we should be able to use the rails and carts, if we’re smart about it."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_53",
        on: "attack_end",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
